{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:59 2026-08-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:59 2026-08-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:59 2026-08-22 HKT</p><p>由於今日是好日、呂健威、賀賢、桂福特及告東尼馬房均拜神。</p><p>其中賀賢和太太李姿敏齊齊出席拜神儀式，祈求新季事事順利；出席馬主包括「嘉應」系馬主梁錫光、「威力」系馬主曾炳威及「澳華」系馬主方奕聰。</p><p>騎師方面，則有女見習騎師黃寶妮、潘明輝、潘頓及奧爾民等。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1b7b12338a24096801b85c99b37f9aaf/2026-08/85ef35fc-1fb9-4b0b-b24f-9efdd56d8201.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1ed793b2e187ccf0506cc93131f035d5/2026-08/6500c13f-85f0-4aa0-9391-8e4911353f1f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2e3ad69348e874a3574879d0934a5789/2026-08/73015792-90f8-4ec5-b4d9-01caaa889231.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bf1bdfba968a3a63b31c7445345816a8/2026-08/af675f58-0cdd-4de9-adb3-408fdfe55048.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7810e7648b013a0e641b2785c0026129/2026-08/c74eb11d-3e5b-4180-b692-21ec0d25ab6e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/319986757f4858016c5d43f93126fbad/2026-08/c4731689-4933-4aca-9fea-ab7429a57299.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5221e6c80ab0d501a7c5f5b3677379cb/2026-08/ccb6ad90-cfab-4b39-8db2-ed9cc27eb0ba.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/05923de9c06156c9e0cd12ffae859141/2026-08/dea9fb3d-3a00-410e-be50-274b1e057039.jpg\"/><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T10:19:05.912718+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}